check 1
# `operate` (specs/tools/poke.md §1, §4 rule 10, §5 rule 4): the Rogue
# Encampment stash (objects 267, at (4866, 4229) in this town) from the
# start position (4873, 4228), ScnAma, -seed 1234, no input. Before frame
# 4 one `operate @2:267`: the server's dispatcher run at once with 0x13
# {2, stash GUID} on both sides; out of operate range the handler walks the
# player to it and operates on arrival (world/objects.md §7.3). Frames
# 4-30 compare the player's walk, the stash's mode and the S->C replies.
# Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name interact-operate-stash
save ScnAma --class ama --expansion
seed 1234
ticks 30
seconds 300
channels state packets
at 4 poke operate @2:267
